{{also|water line}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
{{compound|water|line|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|nautical}} A line formed by the [[surface]] of the [[water]] on the [[hull]] of a [[ship]] when she is [[afloat]]; any of a series of short lines marked on the hull to show where the waterline would be under different [[loading]]s.
# {{label|en|aviation}} A horizontal line indicating the shape of an airfoil.
# A line showing where the water has been, usually a line separating dry land and wet areas; a [[watermark]] or [[tidemark]].
# {{label|en|cosmetics}} the inner rim of the eyelid, just behind the [[lash line]]; primarily used in reference to the application of [[eyeliner]].

====Coordinate terms====
* {{sense|aviation}} {{l|en|section}}, {{l|en|buttock line}}

